# The Tauri shell stays a workspace member (pnpm --frozen-lockfile needs its
# package.json) but its Rust build output is 2.4 GB and never reaches the web
# build. Everything else here is docs or tooling the Next.js build never reads.
apps/mac/src-tauri/target
apps/mac/dist
drafts
supabase
prompts
specs
*.md

# apps/extension and scripts/ are NOT excluded: the web build zips the
# extension into public/ so /extension can actually serve it. Excluding them is
# why /capso-extension.zip 404'd on every deployment while working locally.
